# PlotForge — Complete Codebase & Architecture Notes

## 1. What PlotForge is

**PlotForge** is a full-stack writing platform for:

* Story writing
* Screenplay writing
* AI-assisted writing and review
* Collaborative editing
* Project version history
* Prequel/sequel/story-source linking
* Fan theories and fan concepts
* Movie/TV metadata through TMDB
* PDF/TXT export
* Public/private sharing
* User authentication and Google authentication

### Overall architecture

```text
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │     React Frontend  │
                    │     Vite + JSX      │
                    └─────────┬───────────┘
                              │
                    REST API / WebSocket
                              │
                              ▼
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │  Express Backend    │
                    │     Node + TS       │
                    └─────┬──────┬────────┘
                          │      │
              ┌───────────┘      └──────────────┐
              ▼                                  ▼
       ┌─────────────┐                   ┌──────────────┐
       │ JSON Store  │                   │ External APIs│
       │ /data/*.json│                   │ Gemini/TMDB  │
       └─────────────┘                   └──────────────┘
              │
              ▼
       Persistent application data

       WebSocket path:
       React ↔ STOMP-compatible WS server ↔ Express/store
```

