# 32. AI rate limiting

`server/middleware/aiRateLimit.ts` limits AI usage.

Why:

```text
AI API = expensive external resource
```

Without a limiter:

```text
user
 ↓
thousands of requests
 ↓
Gemini bill/API exhaustion
```

With rate limiting:

```text
user
 ↓
request window
 ↓
allowed requests
 ↓
then 429
```

