# 59. Final Architecture Summary

The cleanest way to explain PlotForge in an interview is:

```text
                    PLOTForge
                       │
        ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
        │              │              │
    FRONTEND        BACKEND           AI
        │              │              │
      React          Express        Gemini
      Vite           JWT            SSE
      Axios          bcrypt         Personas
      Tailwind       WebSocket      Rate limit
        │              │
        └───────┬──────┘
                │
             DATA LAYER
                │
         In-memory models
                +
          JSON persistence
                │
        ┌───────┴─────────┐
        │                 │
       TMDB          Auth providers
                        │
                    Google/Firebase
```

The architectural story is therefore:

**React handles the experience → Express handles the application → ****`store.ts`**** handles current persistence → Gemini handles AI → TMDB handles media metadata → WebSockets handle collaboration → JWT/bcrypt/Google handle identity and security.**
